window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A pawn in her abductors' scheme for revenge, one runaway heiress discovers that surrender might be her biggest turn-on yet, in this spicy dark romance.</b></p> <p>Foxglove Noire thought she had left Noire House and the nefarious underworld of the Anguis behind for good. But no matter how far she ran, she was never going to be safe from the forested mansion of her childhood—a truth she is confronted with when she is drugged, abducted, and dragged back to Port Macabre, a hostage to three brutes as beautiful as they are cruel.</p> <p>And this time, Fox may not <i>want</i> to escape. While her abductors—Thorne, Raven, and Kyron—seek vengeance against Noire House, Fox's fury toward them transforms into something else entirely. For the lilac-haired beauty has discovered there is exquisite pleasure in surrender.</p> <p>From Ky's irresistible playfulness to Ven's insatiable appetite and Thorne's passionate demands, Fox is completely beholden. And it soon becomes clear her captors are equally captivated. When their enemies come for her, they will do anything to protect their most precious possession.</p> <p><b>This edition features a never-before-published bonus scene and novella.</b></p> <p>Vengeful Gods <i>is a contemporary MMFM why-choose/polyamorous dark revenge romance. Expect a hot, gritty bisexual enemies-to-lovers tale with ruthless, morally gray love interests. For mature listeners. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
